\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YWNjGmT_ixUQ7kNvwHyTyqm&_nc_oc=AdlsaT3fsZMlk2KpSCh746QU64AnAAEvTzF1gL6wHY18k8cGM7FVnGb3nRmuNbrTnGw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzTjWvRXWQQydZyONvhfsBbbM32iLywDBgpgtakuMGD9g&oe=69BD2DF4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mlIdL7esRVcQ7kNvwFEhVbA&_nc_oc=AdljqUUCy2CdeAQP0l2dhOxikxzx85P6TejU9tos3pZxp0ezJARGrgq8v-iNDXwsbI8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfycKu1qsmUUuwTyZdnl2GG7J0Xdnb9KTLdbKL9gBgoq9A&oe=69BD2F56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YLKuSAer8lAQ7kNvwHumKjo&_nc_oc=AdkomZdoNCuz_rPw67l7qjdE--7xU5iDtI2d7IGh78-lmnUJnsUUow2mtl59aTh3TcQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw6YCtsxfwJ8a9yvebqN27O62L4lBg_fScZNu0ZEubR6w&oe=69BD4477"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771